#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2229 expect=skipped domain=TF
#note "PLAN-function-surface-wave1 phase 3: the no-dictionary SKIP pin for the neoplasm type (K4-DICT, once per dictionary type). Row 1 is the misaligned Papilloma/MALIGNANT pair of the invalid scenario, but #dictionaries is DELIBERATELY ABSENT, so the rule MUST report SKIPPED. Red under the phase-3 S3a/S3b sabotage by design."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset TF class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TFSEQ    type=Num
col TFTESTCD type=Char
col TFSTRESC type=Char
col TFRESCAT type=Char
---
S01 | TF | 001 | 1 | TUMEXAM | Papilloma | MALIGNANT
S01 | TF | 001 | 2 | TUMEXAM | Sarcoma   | MALIGNANT
